        <mxCell id="v-44" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Firestore is a document database: “FK” fields store another document’s ID.&lt;br&gt;• References to the staff or user who acted (createdBy, actorId, submitter), and the capture session’s siteId, are shown as FK fields only, to keep lines readable.&lt;br&gt;• Technical collections (hashes, quotas, counters, audit and upload intents) are omitted." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2090" y="840" width="280" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
